
DESCRIPTION:
QNN-platform-validator is a tool to check the capabilities of a device.
------------
ARGUMENTS:
-------------------
  --backend <BACKEND>   Specify the backend to validate. <BACKEND> : gpu, dsp, all
  --coreVersion         Query the backend core descriptor. 
  --libVersion          Query the backend core library API.
  --testBackend         Run diagnostic tests on the specified backend.
  --targetPath <DIR>    The directory to save output to. Defaults to /data/local/tmp/platformValidator/output
  --debug               Turn on verbose logging.
  --help                Show this help message.


__QAIRT_ISOLATED_EXIT__=0
